nged; and the corrected architecture.md and limits.md paragraphs agreeing with each other and with the delivered behaviour, with limits.md's census attributed to ed87935e and the zero-refusal and five-week headroom claims withdrawn. Evidence: gates-v2.txt (all rc 0 at the final code tree and at ea02145f, with one whole-module run red on two load-sensitive cmd/gs stderr-banner tests in a file byte-identical to d1ae6ade, stated and reproduced), wholemodule-rerun.txt (clean repeat, every package green, cmd/gs 519.6s), and mutants.txt (thirteen earlier guards re-run red plus three correction mutants: the restored zero-ceiling defect red on both new controls and deliberately green on the ordinary-ceiling control, and the forbidden blanket refusal red on both new controls).","head":"ea02145f645ec64bc91f9b63333d17fb8e2eba5b","no_git_artifact":"true","stale_bases":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:265e62dc4f39768943d41b126809e020034757f5, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:59154b8746afa9148f9c48026b269b6fdaabc8b1, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:b48122a2cf9bb2cddbcf4d43b38424eb29474c19, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:c31754cf1152e84076518f42867e7594f58e2f4a stale; retired bases: git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:001b2e3b06105d22946682cb90201bc66c1c6a26, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:015aba51ab6c2416861618c5ac3c9ae0e444f17f, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:015bb3acec403ed0d43bcd2a3c38bd188f7740ef, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:02bae1e811fde13104ef614631ac608dca7a7295 and 174 more","to":"5f12e916d136b0c1ed941aa99f4c47af94021451e31d08159d8df368e9946123"}}